==Dutch==

===Etymology===
See {{m|nl|over}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|nl|Nl-over-.ogg|Audio}}

===Prefix===
{{head|nl|prefix}}

# Prepended to verbs; denotes that action takes place [[over]] the object.
#: ''Hij '''over'''sproeide de planten''.
#:: He sprayed '''over''' the plants.
# Prepended to verbs, nouns and adjectives; denotes that the action or state takes place [[excessively]].
#: ''De man '''over'''eet zich''.
#:: The man [[overeats]].

{{prefixsee|nl}}

===Usage notes===
The second meaning is not shared by compounds with the adverb {{l|nl|over}}.

